                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A great roguelike experience for the price! \n\n[list]\n    [*] Fastpaced action which rewards thinking on your toes.\n    [*] Solid Mechanics (Loved that you have to reload)\n    [*] Risk vs Reward Gameplay\n    [*] Great Soundtrack\n    [*] Visuals are awesome!\n    [*] Pretty difficult, even on normal difficulty mode. (Which is awesome, some games should require skill IMO)\n[/list]\n\nOnly criticism I have is that I wish there was an indicator (maybe there is and I didn't notice it) that would show which direction the last few enemies were. I've had to fully explore a few levels looking for the last enemy that wasn't chasing toward me for whatever reason. \n\n\nOverall, I definitely think this is well worth the price and I'll be playing a lot more of it going forward!\n\nThanks for reading!",
